#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr "Utilizazón Básica"

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting &kivio;"
msgstr "Iniciando &kivio;"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Like other &koffice; applications, on startup &kivio; presents a startup "
"dialog. The dialog offers a choice of creating a new document, opening a "
"saved document or choosing a document from a list of recently saved files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you're new to &kivio; begin by creating an empty document by double-"
"clicking on the <guilabel>Empty Document</guilabel> template."
msgstr ""
"Se é novo en &kivio; comece por crear un documento valeiro facendo un duplo-"
"click no modelo <guilabel>Documento Valeiro</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:22
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kivio;'s main window contains a view of the current document. The page "
"outline and margins are shown, as is a grid. Surrounding this view are "
"horizontal and vertical rules. By default a tools toolbar is placed on the "
"left-hand side and beneath the document view is a page selector. Beneath "
"that is the status bar which shows the current position of the mouse pointer "
"as a location on the page."
msgstr ""
"A xanela principal de &kivio; contén unha vista do documento actual. "
"Móstranse o contorno e as marxes da páxina, cunha grella. Arredor desta "
"vista hai regras horizontais e verticais. Por omisión ponse unha barra de "
"ferramentas no lado esquerdo e un selector de páxina por baixo da vista do "
"documento. Baixo este selector está a barra de estado que mostra a posición "
"actual do ponteiro do rato na páxina."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the top of the window are the two main toolbars. These contain buttons "
"for the most commonly used features of &kivio;."
msgstr ""
"Na parte superior da xanela están as dúas barras de ferramentas principais. "
"Esta conteñen botóns para as funcionalidades mais usadas de &kivio;."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using Stencils"
msgstr "Uso das Figuras"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Diagrams are created by placing different pre-drawn shapes and stencils on "
"the page. Stencils can represent many different things and &kivio; comes "
"with a wide selection. For ease of reference they are grouped into "
"collections known as stencil sets. To use a stencil set select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guisubmenu>Add Stencil Set</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice>. The stencil sets have been sub-divided into "
"several groups; a sub-menu lists these. The shapes in the stencil set are "
"shown on the left-hand side of the document view."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:29
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stencils are grouped into stencil sets for organizational purposes only; it "
"is perfectly okay to add several stencil sets to a document and &kivio; "
"allows you to mix and match stencils from different sets freely."
msgstr ""
"As figuras están agrupadas en paquetes de figuras só co propósito de "
"organiza-las; é perfeitamente correcto engadir varios paquetes de figuras a "
"un documento e &kivio; permítelle mistura-las e unir figuras de diferente "
"paquetes sen pór trabas."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To place a stencil onto the document simply drag it from the stencil area to "
"the page."
msgstr ""
"Para situar unha figura no documento simplesmente arrástrea da área de "
"figuras para a páxina."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting Stencils"
msgstr "Selección de Figuras"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kivio; identifies the stencil currently being edited by displaying eight "
"green squares on the corners and edges of a square around the stencil. "
"Stencils shown in this manner are described as being selected. The green "
"rectangles are known as handles. To change the currently selected stencil "
"move the mouse pointer over the stencil you wish to select and press the "
"&LMB;. To select all the stencils on the current page select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Select All</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. To deselect all stencils select <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Deselect</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"&kivio; identifica a figura que está a editar mostrando oito cadros verdes "
"nos cantos e contorno dun recadro que rodea a figura. As figuras que son "
"mostradas deste xeito dise que están escollidas. Os rectángulos verdes son "
"denominados asas. Para cambiar de figura escollida mova o ponteiro do rato "
"sobre a figura que desexa escoller e prema o &LMB;. Para escoller todas as "
"figuras da páxina actual escolla <menuchoice><guimenu>Editar</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Escoller Todas</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Para deseleccionar "
"todas as figuras escolla <menuchoice><guimenu>Editar</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Deseleccionar</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moving Stencils"
msgstr "Mover Figuras"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To move a stencil to another position on the page, select the stencil. Note "
"the pointer will change to a hand icon. Hold down the &LMB; and move the "
"mouse to the new position. Release the mouse button to place the stencil at "
"the new position."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resizing a Stencil"
msgstr "Mudar o tamaño dunha Figura"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the stencil, and then move the mouse pointer over one of the handles. "
"Note the mouse pointer change. Hold down the &LMB; and move the mouse. The "
"coordinates of the stencil will be adjusted continuously as the mouse is "
"moved. When you are happy with the new size release the mouse button to give "
"the stencil its new final size."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Undoing a Mistake"
msgstr "Desfacer un Erro"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If at any time you are unhappy with a change you have made to the document "
"you can select <menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Undo</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> to revert the change. There is also an icon on the "
"toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Se nalgún momento non está contento cunha acción que fixese no documento "
"pode escoller <menuchoice><guimenu>Editar</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Desfacer</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> para anulala. Tamén hai un ícone na barra de "
"ferramentas."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you undo an action and decide that was a mistake, select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Edit</guimenu><guimenuitem>Redo</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> to restore the change. &kivio; stores multiple actions to undo/"
"redo several changes."
msgstr ""
"Se desfai unha acción e decide que non era un erro, escolla "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Editar</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Refacer</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> para restaurar os cambios. &kivio; guarda várias accións para "
"poder desfacer/refacer varias accións."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Limitations of the Stencils"
msgstr "Limitacións das Figuras"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note that stencils cannot currently be rotated."
msgstr "Na actualidade as figuras non poden ser rotadas."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Labeling Stencils"
msgstr "Escreber nas Figuras"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A lot of stencils in the <guilabel>Flowcharting Collections</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Geographic Collections</guilabel>, <guilabel>Hardware Collections</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Miscellaneous Collections</guilabel> and <guilabel>UML "
"Collections</guilabel> can contain text to describe their function. To add "
"text to a stencil move the mouse pointer over the stencil and double-click "
"it or open the context menu with the &RMB; and select <guimenuitem>Edit "
"Text...</guimenuitem>. A dialog box will appear prompting for some text. "
"Enter some text and click <guibutton>OK</guibutton>. The text should be "
"shown inside the stencil."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The item <guimenuitem>Edit Text...</guimenuitem> in the menu is disabled, if "
"a stencil cannot be labeled."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The font, size, alignment and style of the text can be adjusted by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Format</guimenu><guimenuitem>Text...</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. Alternatively use the buttons on the Format toolbar. The "
"adjustments will only affect the currently selected stencil."
msgstr ""
"O tipo de letra, tamaño, aliñamento e estilo do texto poden ser axustados "
"escollendo <menuchoice><guimenu>Formato</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Texto...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Como alternativa pode usar os botóns na barra de "
"ferramentas Formato. Os axustes só afectarán á figura actualmente escollida."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting Several Stencils"
msgstr "Escoller Varias Figuras"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are two ways to select multiple stencils in &kivio;."
msgstr "Hai duas maneira de escoller varias figuras en &kivio;."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click once inside the first stencil you wish to select. Hold down &Ctrl; as "
"you click inside subsequent stencils. All the stencils will be shown with "
"handles around them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Move the mouse pointer to a blank area of the document near the stencils you "
"want to select."
msgstr ""
"Mova o ponteiro do rato sobre unha área valeira do documento perto das "
"figuras que desexe escoller."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hold down the &LMB; and move the mouse to the other side of the stencils you "
"want to select, drawing a rectangle around them."
msgstr ""
"Manteña premido o &LMB; e mova o rato para o outro lado das figuras que "
"desexe escoller, debuxando un rectángulo arredor delas."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:84
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The rectangle must completely encompass the stencils for them to be selected."
msgstr "O rectángulo debe rodear por inteiro as figuras para seren escollidas."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adjusting the Fill Color and Line Color"
msgstr "Axustar a Cor de Recheo e a Cor da Liña"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stencils can be filled with a solid color and the color of the outline can "
"be changed. Select a stencil then select <menuchoice><guimenu>Format</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Stencils &amp; Connectors...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adjusting the Line Thickness"
msgstr "Axustar o Ancho da Liña"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The width of a stencil's border can be adjusted by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Format</guimenu><guimenuitem>Stencils &amp; "
"Connectors...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. The line width can be entered in "
"centimeters or increased/decreased using the arrows of the spin box. Or use "
"the <guibutton>Line Width</guibutton> button on the <guilabel>Format</"
"guilabel> toolbar. Select a width from the drop down box or select "
"<guilabel>Custom...</guilabel> to open enter the width in the spin box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Connecting Shapes Together"
msgstr "Conectar as Figuras"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kivio;'s connector tool allows lines to be drawn between shapes. The lines "
"remain connected to the shapes even when the shapes are moved to new "
"positions on the page."
msgstr ""
"Os conectores de &kivio; permiten debuxar liñas entre as figuras. As liñas "
"ficarán conectadas ás figuras mesmo se estas son movidas para novas "
"posicións na páxina."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To draw a connector select <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Straight Connector</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Polyline Connector</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Polyline Connector</guilabel> tool is also available from the "
"<guilabel>Tools</guilabel> toolbar; by default shown on the top side of the "
"window. Click on this tool to begin using it; the mouse pointer will change "
"shape."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Notice that all stencils have little blue crosses around their edges. These "
"crosses mark points where connectors can be attached."
msgstr ""
"Lembre que as figuras teñen pequenas cruces azuis en pontos do seu contorno. "
"Estas cruces marcan os pontos onde pode unirlles conectores."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To connect two stencils move to one of the connection points on the first "
"stencil, hold down the &LMB; and drag a line to one of the connection points "
"on the second stencil. The green square at the end of the line will change "
"to red when it is over a connection point indicating that the line is "
"attached to a stencil."
msgstr ""
"Para conectar duas figuras vaia para un dos pontos de conexón da primeira "
"figura, manteña premido o &LMB; e arraste unha liña a un dos pontos de "
"conexón da segunda figura. O cadro verde á fin da liña cambiará para "
"vermello cando estexa sobre un ponto de conexón indicando que a liña está "
"unida a unha figura."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:108
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you have finished using the connector tool, click on the "
"<guiicon>Arrow</guiicon> tool to regain normal selection functionality."
msgstr ""
"Cando remate de usar a ferramenta de conexón, prema no ícone "
"<guiicon>Frecha</guiicon> para tornar á función normal de selección."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A stencil can have multiple connectors attached to it, even at the same "
"connection point."
msgstr ""
"Unha figura pode ter múltiplos conectores unidos a el, mesmo no mesmo ponto "
"de conexón."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Various properties of the connector can be adjusted including line thickness "
"and color, this is done in the same way as for stencils."
msgstr ""
"Pode axustar varias propriedades do conector incluindo o ancho e a cor, isto "
"faise igual que para as figuras."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Straight Connectors</guilabel> may also be labeled with text. To "
"add text to a straight connector open the context menu with the &RMB; and "
"select <guimenuitem>Edit Text...</guimenuitem>. Enter the text in the dialog "
"that appears. The text will be shown with a green handle next to it. Use "
"this to modify the position of the text."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Arrowheads can be added to either end of a connector. Select the connector "
"and then select <menuchoice><guimenu>Format</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Arrowheads...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Limitations: Connectors do not currently reroute around stencils, you need "
"to adjust them manually. Text is always displayed horizontally; rotated text "
"is not currently possible."
msgstr ""
"Limitacións: As conexóns por agora non se dispoñen arredor das figuras, "
"deberá face-lo por si mesmo. O texto sempre estará horizontal; aínda non se "
"admite texto rotado."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Grouping Stencils"
msgstr "Agrupar Figuras"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Several stencils may be semi-permanently grouped together. Once this has "
"been done any changes made to one stencil will affect the others in the "
"group."
msgstr ""
"Pode agrupar varias figuras de xeito semi-permanente. Unha vez que o faga "
"calquer mudanza feita a unha figura afectará tamén ás outras do grupo."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To make a group select the stencils and select <menuchoice><guimenu>Format</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Group Selection</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Para facer un grupo escolla as figuras e use <menuchoice><guimenu>Formato</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Agrupar Selección</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The procedure can be reversed by selecting a group of stencils and select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Format</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ungroup</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"O procedimento pode ser anulado escollendo un grupo de figuras e escollendo "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Formato</guimenu><guimenuitem>Desagrupar</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Overlaying Stencils"
msgstr "Sobrepor Figuras"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stencils can be positioned on top of one another. A stencil drawn on top of "
"another stencil will obscure the stencil underneath it. To adjust the "
"drawing order select one of the stencils and select either "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Format</guimenu><guimenuitem>Bring to Front</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> or <menuchoice><guimenu>Format</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Send to Back</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"As figuras poden estar sobrepostas. Unha figura debuxada por riba de outra "
"tapará a de baixo. Para axustar a orde de debuxado escolla unha das figuras "
"e escolla ou <menuchoice><guimenu>Formato</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Traer para "
"o frente</guimenuitem></menuchoice> ou <menuchoice><guimenu>Formato</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Enviar para o fondo</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Send to Back</guimenuitem> will cause the stencil to be "
"obscured by any stencil which overlaps it. <guimenuitem>Bring to Front</"
"guimenuitem> will cause the stencil to obscure any stencil which it overlaps."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Enviar para o fondo</guimenuitem> fará que a figura sexa tapada "
"por calquer outra que se lle sobrepoña. <guimenuitem>Traer para o Frente</"
"guimenuitem> fará que a figura tape calquer outra coa que se solape."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "Locking Stencils"
msgstr "Trancar as Figuras"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A stencil's properties may be <quote>locked</quote> to prevent accidental "
"changes. To alter a stencil's protection use the protection palette. This "
"can be displayed by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Palettes</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Show Protection</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Select the stencil or stencils you wish to "
"protect and then tick the properties you want to protect on the protection "
"palette."
msgstr ""
"As propriedades das figuras poden ser <quote>trancadas</quote> para evitar "
"mudanzas acidentais. Para modificar a protección dunha figura use a paleta "
"de protección. Esta móstrase mediante <menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Paletas</guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Mostrar Protección</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Escolla a figura ou figuras que desexe protexer e "
"sinales as propriedades que queira protexer na paleta de protección."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The protections available are: <guilabel>Width</guilabel>, <guilabel>Height</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Aspect ratio</guilabel>, <guilabel>X position</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Y position</guilabel> and <guilabel>Deletion</"
"guilabel>. Deletion prevents a stencil from being deleted from the document."
msgstr ""
"As proteccións disponíbeis son: <guilabel>Ancho</guilabel>, <guilabel>Alto</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Proporcións</guilabel>, <guilabel>Posicion X</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Posición Y</guilabel> e <guilabel>Borrado</guilabel>. O "
"borrado evita que unha figura sexa eliminada do documento."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stencil Geometry"
msgstr "Xeometría da Figura"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:137
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For accurately specifying the dimensions of a stencil use the Geometry "
"palette. To display the palette select <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Palettes</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Show Geometry</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. The palette contains four spin boxes for "
"specifying the horizontal (<guilabel>X:</guilabel>) and vertical "
"(<guilabel>Y:</guilabel>) position of the stencil and the <guilabel>Width:</"
"guilabel> and <guilabel>Height:</guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Para especificar con exactitude as dimensións dunha figura use a paleta de "
"Xeometría. Pode mostrar a paleta mediante <menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Paletas</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Mostrar Xeometría</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. A paleta contén catro campos numéricos para "
"especificar as posicións horizontal (<guilabel>X:</guilabel>) e vertical "
"(<guilabel>Y:</guilabel>) da figura e o <guilabel>Ancho:</guilabel> e "
"<guilabel>Alto:</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:139
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Although the measurements are displayed in centmeters it is possible to "
#| "enter other units into the textbox. For example, entering 2.5 mm will be "
#| "converted into centimeter. Points (pt) and inches (in) are also accepted."
msgid ""
"Although the measurements are displayed in centimeters it is possible to "
"enter other units into the textbox. For example, entering 2.5 mm will be "
"converted into centimeter. Points (pt) and inches (in) are also accepted."
msgstr ""
"Apesar de que as medidas son mostradas en centímetros é posíbel usar outras "
"unidades nos campos de texto. Por exemplo, se escrebe 2.5 mm será convertido "
"en centímetros. Tamén pode usar pontos (pt) ou polegadas (in)."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Viewing the Document"
msgstr "Ver o Documento"

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Zooming In and Out"
msgstr "Ampliar e Reducir"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To adjust the zoom level select <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Zoom Level</guisubmenu></menuchoice>. This submenu "
"contains a list of percentages from 33% to 500%; selecting one of these "
"magnify the document by that percentage."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is also a list of zoom levels in a spin box on the <guilabel>Edit</"
"guilabel> toolbar, by default shown at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Tamén hai unha lista de níveis de ampliación nunha entrada numérica na barra "
"de ferramentas de <guilabel>Edición</guilabel>, mostrada por omisión na "
"parte de riba da xanela."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A second method of controlling the magnification is to use the zoom tool. "
"This is available on the <guilabel>Tools</guilabel> toolbar. This tool can "
"be used in two ways. Clicking on the document with the zoom tool active will "
"increase the magnification. Holding down the &Shift; key whilst clicking "
"will decrease the magnification, &ie; zoom out."
msgstr ""
"Hai un segundo método de controlar a ampliación que é usar a ferramenta de "
"ampliación. Esta está disponíbel na barra de ferramentas "
"<guilabel>Ferramentas</guilabel>. Pode usala de dúas maneiras. Se preme no "
"documento coa ferramenta de ampliación activa aumentará o documento. Se "
"mantén premida a tecla &Shift; mentres preme no documento diminuirá a "
"ampliación, &ie; reducirá."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, holding down the &LMB; and dragging out a box then releasing "
"the mouse button will increase the magnification so that that portion of the "
"document fills the available space."
msgstr ""
"Como alternativa, se mantén premido o &LMB; e arrasta o ponteiro para "
"debuxar un cadro e logo solta o botón ampliará para ver a parte escollida en "
"todo o espazo disponíbel."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Panning the Document"
msgstr "Desprazarse polo Documento"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guiicon>Pan Document</guiicon> tool lets you move the document around, "
"adjusting the portion that is visible. This is very useful when working at "
"high magnifications where the entire document is not completely visible. To "
"pan a document select <guiicon>Pan Document</guiicon> from the "
"<guilabel>Tools</guilabel> toolbar or <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Pan Document</guisubmenu></menuchoice> in the menu. Once "
"activated the mouse pointer turns into a hand. To move the document move the "
"mouse over the currently visible portion, hold down the &LMB; and drag."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Overview"
msgstr "O Esquema"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Overview</guilabel> palette provides a quick way of adjusting "
"the zoom level and moving around the document. To enable it select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guisubmenu>Palettes</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Overview</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"A paleta de <guilabel>Resumo</guilabel> fornece un xeito rápido de axustar o "
"nível de ampliación e desprazar polo documento. Pode activala mediante "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu><guisubmenu>Paletas</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Resumo</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A miniature representation of the document itself is shown underneath. A red "
"rectangle indicates the portion that is currently visible. Clicking anywhere "
"on this representation pans the view to that area. The rectangle can also be "
"dragged."
msgstr ""
"Verá unha miniatura do documento por baixo. Un rectángulo vermello indica a "
"parte que está visíbel. Se preme en calquer parte desta miniatura verá esa "
"área. O rectángulo pode ser arrastado."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the palette there is a slider and two buttons to zoom 25% "
"in or out."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using Palettes"
msgstr "Uso das Paletas"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All palettes have a handle on the top side which enables them to be moved "
"around and positioned on any edge of the main view. They can also float "
"anywhere on the screen. To hide or show a palette select it from "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guisubmenu>Palettes</guisubmenu></"
"menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Todas as paletas teñen unha asa ou suxeición na parte de cima que permite "
"que sexan movidas e postas en calquer borde da vista principal. Tamén poden "
"estar flutuando en calquer espazo da xanela. Para acochar ou mostrar unha "
"paleta use <menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Paletas</"
"guisubmenu></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Multiple Views"
msgstr "Múltiplas vistas"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is possible to have multiple views of the same document displayed "
"simultaneously."
msgstr "É posíbel ter varias vistas dun documento concomitantemente."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <guimenuitem>New View</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>View</guimenu> "
"menu and a new &kivio; window showing the same document will appear. This is "
"very useful for multiple monitor setups."
msgstr ""
"Escolla <guimenuitem>Nova Vista</guimenuitem> no menú de <guimenu>Vista</"
"guimenu> e aparecerá unha nova xanela de &kivio; mostrando o mesmo "
"documento. Isto é moi útil se dispón de varios monitores."

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The additional windows can be closed and &kivio; will only prompt you to "
"save the document when the last window is closed. All windows pertaining to "
"a particular document can be closed simultaneously by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Close All Views</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"As xanelas adicionais poden ser pechadas e &kivio; só lle ha perguntar se "
"quer guardar o documento cando peche a última. Todas as xanelas que "
"pertenzan a un documento en concreto pode sen pechadas á vez mediante "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Vista</guimenu><guimenuitem>Pechar Todas as Vistas</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "Split Views"
msgstr "Dividir a Vista"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is also possible to split the window into two or more portions which can "
"be used to view two areas of a document at once. To split a window select "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Split View</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>. The orientation of the split can be changed from horizontal to "
"vertical using <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guisubmenu>Splitter "
"Orientation</guisubmenu></menuchoice>. To restore the window to its original "
"state select <menuchoice><guimenu>View</guimenu><guimenuitem>Remove View</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: usage.docbook:197
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing the Display"
msgstr "Personalizar a Pantalla"

#. Tag: para
#: usage.docbook:198
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>View</guimenu> menu contains options for toggling the display "
"of page margins, rulers, guides and the grid."
msgstr ""
"O menú <guimenu>Vista</guimenu> contén opcións para comutar a visualización "
"das marxes da páxina, regras, guías e a grella."
